  "rules": [
    "Only explicit circular nodes connect streets; crossings do not create junctions.",
    "Customers have two entrances and retain legacy stop IDs. Customers are not transit shortcuts.",
    "C-J has separate normal and water arcs.",
    "Routing minimizes movement turns including two-edge vehicle turns, remaining vehicle uses and early NPC/station stops; curve length breaks ties.",
    "H/W/Q (6/7/8) exchange the current vehicle for a fresh 5-turn heatproof/amphibious/suspension vehicle; exchange costs 1 order turn. Protection belongs only to the current vehicle.",
    "Ghost: 1 edge/turn. Vehicles: up to 2 edges/turn, stop early at NPCs or H/W/Q. All circular nodes are selectable.",
    "Cargo-only events at end-of-turn nodes: C/J delay +1; N/P/E retreat one node. Configurable 35% probability; at most one event per order."
  ],
